<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Forcenergy upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Forcenergy upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst James Whipkey upgraded Forcenergy Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 earnings estimate to $1.31 a share from $0.91.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings at $1.74 a share.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $41.</p>
<p>-- Forcenergy shares were up 1/2 to 26.</p>
</text>
